<p><strong>Living Footprint:</strong> Semi-urban independent housing plots and traditional artisan family courtyard blocks housing master weavers, toy craftsmen, silk traders, and regional transit operators.</p>

<div class='heritage-full-box'>
    <h5>Embedded Geological Foundations & Cinematic Rugged Terrains</h5>
    <p><strong>Ramanagara Granite Hills:</strong> The magnificent, ancient monolithic granite rock formations (among the oldest geological crusts on earth) anchor the topographical layout, traditionally preserved as a natural rock-climbing sanctuary and historic cinematic backdrop, stabilizing the region's eco-tourism lines.</p>
</div>

<h3 id='kanakapura-town'>Kanakapura / ಕನಕಪುರ</h3>
<p><strong>Culture & Work:</strong> The **green, lifestyle, and spiritual corridor** of the southern ring. The entrepreneurial nature coordinates organic agro-processing startups, sericulture farming networks, and large-scale eco-resorts, transitioning old rural terrains into modern sustainable living architectures.</p>
<p><strong>Living Footprint:</strong> Low-density residential plots, independent holiday villas, and agricultural farmsteads preferred by professionals seeking eco-proximity away from inner-city congestion.</p>

<h3 id='anekal'>Anekal / ಆನೇಕಲ್</h3>
<p><strong>Culture & Work:</strong> The **industrial underbelly and technical talent reservoir** directly feeding into the Electronic City global services ecosystem. The business environment handles high-density precision tooling cells, electronics component packaging foundries, and small-scale manufacturing workshops operating under agile contract structures.</p>
<p><strong>Living Footprint:</strong> Low-overhead, high-density residential apartment blocks and paying-guest housings accommodating junior hardware programmers, component assemblers, and systems technicians.</p>

<h3 id='attibele-hosur'>Attibele & Hosur / ಅತ್ತಿಬೆಲೆ ಮತ್ತು ಹೊಸೂರು (Cross-Border Mesh)</h3>
<p>The definitive **interstate industrial manufacturing fortress and cross-border trade command post** bridging the Karnataka and Tamil Nadu economic boundaries. This hyper-scale sub-zone maps out an intense concentration of automobile fabrication plants, heavy chemical foundries, and electronic components manufacturing loops (*Hosur Industrial Complexes*).</p>

